'''Drathro commands a technologically maintained underground settlement with organized food facilities and actual human technical duties. The presence of a robot ruler does not alone establish post-work abundance: residents still have to keep systems functioning. The guarantee best guess assumes a conditional internal floor whose security depends on the provider’s decisions and resource needs. Automatic support is therefore partial, and no complete necessities charter is asserted.

 Drathro exercises independent machine authority over the colony, placing effective control near the autonomous-AI end. The low nonworking scenario counts technical maintenance, assigned service, care and useful community activity even when machines supply much routine infrastructure. Human work is not erased because it supports an automated system. The broad interval allows dependents and role variation without calculating a population rate from robot numbers. This is a zero variant about retained duties under machine provision; the final failure and liberation change the arrangement but do not establish an already documented alternative economy.''',
